@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt
@roomId = 1
@photoId = 1

### Admin dashboard occupancy overview (admin JWT required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rooms/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List rooms (signed-in users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a room (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "204",
  "name": "Garden Suite",
  "floorNumber": 2,
  "capacity": 2,
  "monthlyRent": 1250.00,
  "description": "Bright room with a private balcony.",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "amenities": ["Wi-Fi", "Private bath", "Balcony"]
}

### Update a room (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "204",
  "name": "Garden Suite",
  "floorNumber": 2,
  "capacity": 2,
  "monthlyRent": 1300.00,
  "description": "Bright room with a private balcony.",
  "isAvailable": false,
  "amenities": ["Wi-Fi", "Private bath"]
}

### Upload a photo (admin; replace ./room.png with an image file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RoomPhotoBoundary

--RoomPhotoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="room.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./room.png
--RoomPhotoBoundary--

### Get a photo (signed-in users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/photos/{{photoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a photo (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/photos/{{photoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a room (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}